        "date": "2026-11-16T15:16:14Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(fixtures): turn a fixture by quarter turns or a typed angle\n\nThe Fixtures page place draft now has the three angles of the Model page\n(roll, pitch, yaw) and six quarter-turn buttons (Turn X+ .. Turn Z-).\nA new undoable TurnFixture command turns a fixture about a world axis\nthrough its origin; its write is a MoveFixture, so plate riders follow.\nQuarter turns land exact quaternions and a no-op turn is refused (#2177).\nA part or stock the fixture held stays and is named in the warning. The\npost gate reads the turned fixture live. New MCP tool turn_fixture.\n\nFixes #2174\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
